#exception-box(title: "THE SEVEN FATAL CUET TRAPS")[
  1. *Trap 1 (China as South Asian State):* Assuming China belongs to South Asia because it shares borders. China is an East Asian state; it is NOT a South Asian state!
  2. *Trap 2 (SAARC Founding vs Headquarters):* SAARC was founded in *Dhaka (1985)*, but its permanent headquarters/secretariat is in *Kathmandu, Nepal*.
  3. *Trap 3 (Afghanistan SAARC Membership Year):* Afghanistan was NOT an original 1985 member; it joined as the 8th member in *2007*.
  4. *Trap 4 (SAFTA Signing vs Operational Year):* SAFTA was signed in *January 2004* in Islamabad; it became operational on *1 January 2006*.
  5. *Trap 5 (Maldives Republic vs Multi-Party Year):* Maldives became a republic in *1968*; multi-party democracy was introduced in *June 2005*.
  6. *Trap 6 (Indus Waters Treaty Mediator):* Believing the UN mediated the Indus Waters Treaty. It was mediated by the *World Bank* in 1960.
  7. *Trap 7 (IPKF Departure Year):* Indian Peace Keeping Force was sent in *1987* by Rajiv Gandhi and completely withdrawn in *1990* by Prime Minister V.P. Singh.
]

